  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "巷仔內ê風景"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>粼&nbsp; &nbsp; 粼</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拄起床，人iáu-koh siān-siān，我the tī膨椅頂kuân愈想愈m̄-tio̍h，平常時無閒kah tńg來厝koh ài加班ê我，tsit个拜六、禮拜竟然完全無khang-khuè，根本是奇蹟！既然án-ne，我beh哪ē-sái坐踮厝內浪費時間--leh？想想--leh，我手機仔隨提--出-來，kan-na十分鐘ê時間，就kā飯店訂好、車票拆好，行李mā簡單款--一-下就好，suà--落-來隨出門坐車--looh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高鐵siu̍h--一-下，就載阮tuì溼溼涼涼ê台北，來到溫暖koh出日頭ê台南，現代ê科技有影厲害。來到市區，行tī彎彎khiau-khiau ê細條巷仔內，攑頭看，竟然是藍色ê天，koh有白siak-siak ê雲；ná行，涼風koh微微仔吹--來，入秋ê天氣真正有夠爽快。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ai-iō！哪ē有細粒石頭仔tuì天頂lak--落-來？是啥mih人tsiah-nī無聊，án-ne創治過路人--leh？是講，哪ē lóng看無人影，奇怪，kám講是我誤會--ah？Ai-iō！又koh一粒石頭仔，到底是siáng？I̋？正手爿hit棟樓仔厝ê六樓陽台kánn-ná有mi̍h件leh tín動，詳細kā看，原來是一隻pan-kah tī花khann頂kuân跳來跳去，koh ná kā石頭仔撥撥--落-來，我看著實在愛笑。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原來自頭到尾lóng是tsit隻「賤蟲」leh創治--人。Aih！我只好頭殼摸摸--leh，繼續向前行。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgskD3b3dg4ciuvIuOaQvfc-5oXOfxb0wGh27AGEOJO3yx6N-cA2uemAaCaOOIFYmOlvo3nPgepvYWio_QimVgUB96xE0s0e-tffnKptlM4r36pOHMgitsCkCPV0ZUi_H4wgnpUOK4OW4Fd6qF07E0eGOOPZ9_L610vpd9-ItW9Fy5PFvBPxi-6dwU7-ZZG/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_32.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgskD3b3dg4ciuvIuOaQvfc-5oXOfxb0wGh27AGEOJO3yx6N-cA2uemAaCaOOIFYmOlvo3nPgepvYWio_QimVgUB96xE0s0e-tffnKptlM4r36pOHMgitsCkCPV0ZUi_H4wgnpUOK4OW4Fd6qF07E0eGOOPZ9_L610vpd9-ItW9Fy5PFvBPxi-6dwU7-ZZG/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_32.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1423\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/w450-h640/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#光景bóng uē&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div